[{"title":"雨夜思家","author":"张桐","text":"咫尺成千里，言归竟未归。\n遣怀亲笔砚，别梦绕庭闱。\n旱潦天心见，炎凉世事非。\n曾经兵燹过，况复遇年饥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24185,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏雪","author":"张桐","text":"天公戏玉太匆忙，顷刻朱楼换粉妆。\n终夜窗明如对月，满庭花落不闻香。\n烟沈野岸鸿泥浅，云锁空山鹤梦凉。\n此夕烹茶添雅兴，一杯清味涤诗肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24186,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尹隐居鉴月亭","author":"陈寅","text":"闲携玉川碗，来上尹公亭。\n一水寂然碧，万山相对青。\n诗心留月鉴，樵响隔云听。\n澹极忘今古，茶烟萦翠屏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24187,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛巳重阳偕长彝亭少农过白云观早酌后独游陶然亭 其一","author":"陈寅","text":"偶出城闉访上清，黄花红叶绚秋晴。\n登高肯负重阳约，纵饮能消万古情。\n文几年陪谢傅，穷愁何计慰虞卿。\n纷纷眼底缁尘满，独对沧浪想濯缨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24188,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛巳重阳偕长彝亭少农过白云观早酌后独游陶然亭 其二","author":"陈寅","text":"客里佳辰几度过，看花聊以慰蹉跎。\n何尝富贵中年逼，已觉飞腾后辈多。\n秋水一方淹日月，斜阳满地怆关河。\n孤亭独上肠堪断，戏马呼鹰奈若何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24189,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沟壑行","author":"陈寅","text":"暴雨下注湍飞山，众河上决涛连天。\n五月六月苗稼残，千顷万顷沟壑宽。\n民居荡析屋不完，釜突湿烂薪难然。\n高田浸巨蛙黾喧，长阡风腥鼋蛟蟠。\n天灾荐臻如竖缠，洪流降割同尧年。\n我困青毡无一钱，目击道殣忧百煎。\n八口尚难安饱温，千厦乌能庇饥寒。\n蔽日不散云冥顽，朝来又见东霞轩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24190,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄张孝达","author":"刘肇均","text":"爱君因意气，岂独昵交亲。\n志略能匡世，文章不救贫。\n遥知鞍马上，应念药炉人。\n欲寄无多语，时危慎笑颦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24191,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋柳","author":"董绍兰","text":"风里枝条弱，秋来雨露匀。\n可怜曾折处，应有未归人。\n莺语久岑寂，蝉声自苦辛。\n谁家羌笛里，犹怨玉关春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24192,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀郑芝庭上舍","author":"商廷焕","text":"玉立仙才郑子真，王园曾与逐车尘。\n悬弧尚记同庚子，解剑恒思订甲寅。\n竞病每联茅店雨，尖叉时煮瓮头春。\n西风昨夜敲檐马，坐对黄花似故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24193,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏园晚坐","author":"商廷焕","text":"元蝉噪夕阳，绿重柳成行。\n有客当风坐，空庭过雨凉。\n日长青史伴，人静白莲香。\n微露新眉月，林间澹澹光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24194,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赵忠毅公铁如意歌","author":"于昌寿","text":"一枝青铁霜华皛，提携四顾乾坤小。\n在昔款署良工张，至今器重尚书赵。\n尚书名共三君隆，风骨铮铮与铁同。\n中宵起舞一击节，千锤百炼如其忠。\n独居深念意不乐，天际云阴起霜鹗。\n想当出手指挥时，委鬼茄花定惊愕。\n其如天不祚明何，钩党沈冤走荷戈。\n风声呜呜鬼神泣，拂拭囊底增悲歌。\n一身万里君门旷，汉关竟绝生还望。\n白骨埋处青山香，流传此铁未从葬。\n公身已去公物存，摩挲欲比钟彝尊。\n光芒上瞩寒星斗，崛强犹是凭忠魂。\n吁嗟铁兮尔何福，名传千载尔余馥。\n长尺四寸重二斤，上镌名字二十六。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24195,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书斋","author":"庄元植","text":"书斋客去倍萧然，坐对黄花瘦可怜。\n一种荒凉谁画得，乱鸦啼破夕阳天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24196,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"花朝","author":"孙显","text":"空山生计太萧条，浊酒填胸气不骄。\n剩有残书如旧雨，那堪佳节又花朝。\n强扶游兴穿松径，聊寄闲情斸药苗。\n解识升沈随大化，将军莫问霍嫖姚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24197,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日","author":"孙显","text":"客里逢人日，萧斋绝可怜。\n雪消檐上雨，冰隔渡头船。\n愁比春还早，宵来梦不全。\n计寻方外去，儒服误多年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24198,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八月九日南郊闲步 其一","author":"姚承燕","text":"出郭皆秋色，寻途荻苇边。\n晚潮寒带雨，孤塔迥凌烟。\n樵爨荒榛辟，犁锄废垒穿。\n拟沽村店酒，生计足渔佃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24199,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八月九日南郊闲步 其二","author":"姚承燕","text":"信见边防固，军资必豫储。\n荒滩屯士马，远海蹑龙鱼。\n机仿法郎造，民疑巢燧居。\n侧闻消寇警，寰宇运舟车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24200,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过桃花坞","author":"秦宝玑","text":"江湖放浪信全真，恸哭唐衢不可论。\n一坞桃花又零落，晓风孤棹过齐门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24201,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小石洞","author":"秦宝玑","text":"云扃终古闭，草色绿岩腰。\n鸣鸟不知处，游蜂如见招。\n洞天晴亦雨，花气午犹潮。\n小坐无僧话，茶香破寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24202,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡太湖口占","author":"汪芑","text":"天连云水荡胸开，自笑乘风破浪才。\n七十二峰青不断，片帆飞过太湖来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24203,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访潘大出郭晚眺","author":"汪芑","text":"言寻邠老去，临眺正苍然。\n树远疑浮水，山高不碍天。\n渔榔鸣浦急，牧笛出村圆。\n薄暮桥头立，平林半没烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24204,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"池上小集","author":"汪芑","text":"病起好酬鸡黍约，崦西头是屋东头。\n豆棚瓜架偏宜雨，柳陌菱塘易得秋。\n鸥梦不离湖上棹，蝉声多傍夕阳楼。\n市嚣输与柴门迥，无数溪山供卧游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24205,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"度峙崦岭至铜坑","author":"汪芑","text":"漠漠云阴二月天，层冈复岭俯平田。\n杏花能白非关雨，杨柳初黄不受烟。\n幽境每从迷路得，吟怀差喜入春妍。\n湖山旧侣销兵燹，寥落晨星感昔年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24206,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陈子韬孝廉诗文集","author":"汪芑","text":"剑气珠光久郁埋，瑶华赠我眼惊开。\n身全浩劫庸非福，诗到名家始敛才。\n赵壹飘零囊底罄，杜陵辛苦贼中来。\n故人尚有王阳在，好对湖山劝一抔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24207,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"黄图成","text":"寂坐浑无赖，天空黑气沈。\n残镫耿寒夜，疏雨碎愁心。\n懒与书相接，聊将酒半斟。\n孤鸿云外响，凄切感人深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24208,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟返盐渎寄邗上诸子","author":"黄图成","text":"还家八十日，浑似客中游。\n雁序倏离别，骊歌空唱酬。\n水天三百里，风雨一扁舟。\n倚枕潮声急，乡心逐浪流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24209,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"越吟","author":"王贞春","text":"东下钱江深复深，渡江一舸入山阴。\n天台此去无多路，流水桃花未易寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24210,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"购得杨升庵先生雪韵楼画像敬赋此诗","author":"王贞春","text":"万里君门远，投荒死未归。\n山花蛮女曲，椎髻汉臣衣。\n木落愁猿啸，仓空宿鸟饥。\n思亲余涕泪，应逐白云飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24211,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼望雨","author":"徐宗亮","text":"黄鹤楼头鹤不归，隔江云气挟山飞。\n盘空急雨垂天下，入望长帆到岸稀。\n水鸟带烟投别树，风豚吹浪撼危矶。\n道人移榻西窗近，爱听江声接卧帏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24212,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠赵新斋秀才","author":"徐宗亮","text":"年少方多病，亲衰更患贫。\n长途怜作客，生计苦依人。\n有鹤形同瘦，如龙性未驯。\n相逢悲握手，添与泪痕新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24213,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过山寺看芍药","author":"徐宗亮","text":"丈室花光照暮天，色香空尽转生妍。\n青山何处容吾隐，看到残春又一年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24214,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"洪山吊罗罗山布政兼感李迪庵旧帅","author":"徐宗亮","text":"洪山一握征南节，并世孤忠叹百身。\n淮蔡专征谁继志，山河凭吊各伤神。\n多材自古传三楚，儒将当时更几人。\n寂寞路旁祠庙在，尚闻风雨泣遗民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24215,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜饮示家人","author":"徐宗亮","text":"闭门无事坐成晚，正是冬深欲雪天。\n乐趣恒妨儿辈觉，酒怀时愧古人贤。\n纸窗镫火团圞夜，茅屋松杉八九椽。\n往事凄凉堪忆否，寒江短景望归船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24216,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"墩子湖","author":"许惠","text":"湖上荷花十万枝，夕阳如醉雨如丝。\n众香国里双栖稳，且为鸳鸯立少时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24217,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"板子矶","author":"许惠","text":"板子矶边江水深，青枫摇落气萧森。\n霜华暗染劳人鬓，帆影孤悬独客心。\n风定寺明煨芋火，月斜港断捣衣砧。\n浮生片刻清凉境，试向中流鼓素琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24218,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿春孙氏东园题壁","author":"许惠","text":"更寻幽僻处，秋气澹斜晖。\n藤曲不堪杖，荷枯谁制衣。\n鼪鼯下上跃，蝙蝠纵横飞。\n予亦忘归客，怅然吟《式微》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24219,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨夜坐","author":"王映薇","text":"西风猎猎雨潇潇，冷焰无光夜寂寥。\n寸草报春心半死，残桐入爨尾全焦。\n旧诗已徇秦灰劫，新鬼难凭楚些招。\n抚髀愁生推枕起，村醪味薄不能浇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24220,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"嫩凉","author":"许斌","text":"嫩凉初试雨余天，天际微云意淡然。\n刚到秋风已萧瑟，夕阳池馆一声蝉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24221,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日历下晚咏","author":"李西堂","text":"斜日冷残照，高城欲暮天。\n远山寒映郭，湖水暗生烟。\n慷慨翻诗卷，凄凉听管弦。\n不须论出处，客里总堪怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24222,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与莫午桥梦槐旋自江南至济宁午桥北上占此话别","author":"李西堂","text":"握手话途穷，乾坤饮泣中。\n饥寒千里共，辛苦两人同。\n愁说君游北，行看我欲东。\n悠悠驱马去，怅望暮云空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24223,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日登少陵台","author":"李西堂","text":"木落西风雁叫哀，黄花满地独登台。\n古人何往名犹在，佳节无端我又来。\n把酒欣逢陶令醉，吟诗转忆少陵才。\n凭高几度栏频倚，寂寞斜阳冷碧苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24224,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后湖上","author":"李西堂","text":"湖上东风雨乍晴，湖中画舫乱歌声。\n七桥柳色青摇水，千佛山光绿上城。\n名士今犹传历下，尚书终是怨燕京。\n不堪往事重怀古，步向沧浪听濯缨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24225,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日村居","author":"李西堂","text":"荒村记树老破篱斜，就里炊烟住几家。\n一夜西风凉过雨，朝来开遍豆棚花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24226,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行","author":"陈世相","text":"千山如拱立，邀我快攀跻。\n路险人踪少，峰高暮色低。\n水声悬峭壁，岩影落深溪。\n小鸟窥予至，惊飞夕照西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24227,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"罗执桓","text":"买得扁舟便是家，一竿一网寄生涯。\n晚来独醉西风里，卧看芙蓉两岸花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24228,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行","author":"胡友兰","text":"晚烟一抹锁前峰，秋老丹枫带醉容。\n隔岭不知何处寺，西风送出数声钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24229,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己酉重阳后一日送家兄赴永丰时予亦重有楚南之行别后感赋 其一","author":"胡友兰","text":"昨日同登高，今朝竟离别。\n萍梗无定踪，中肠九回结。\n执手临前浦，欲语声不发。\n翻恨长江水，为我助呜咽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24230,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己酉重阳后一日送家兄赴永丰时予亦重有楚南之行别后感赋 其二","author":"胡友兰","text":"秋风偏无情，远送片帆去。\n顷刻舟不见，两桨隔云树。\n含愁独自归，一步一回顾。\n秋江今夜月，扁舟泊何处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24231,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独行有感","author":"胡友兰","text":"萧条古道少人过，一径凉风动薜萝。\n黄叶下时秋色老，乱山高处夕阳多。\n半生寥落英雄泪，万里飘零游子歌。\n渐觉年来霜满鬓，客中岁月又蹉跎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24232,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乡思","author":"胡友兰","text":"窗外潇潇响，孤镫淡五更。\n乡思如碧草，一夜雨中生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24233,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陪家兄游石屋岩","author":"胡友兰","text":"一石结为山，山空鬼斧劈。\n旷然启谽谺，堂庑净如拭。\n脉脉泉溜清，肃肃云气逼。\n岩穴漏天光，虚白生四壁。\n何人偏多事，仙佛重装饰。\n纷纷罗拜勤，香烟不暂息。\n祇为求福来，谁赏境幽僻。\n胜地俗所溷，应为山灵惜。\n我兄饶闲情，邀我著游屐。\n洞外霜叶红，洞中莓苔碧。\n小坐布楸枰，衣袂岚翠滴。\n一局犹未终，夕阳已西匿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24234,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过鸡鸣寺","author":"孙垓","text":"落日疲驴踏藓行，鸡笼山接古台城。\n门前远翠千层币，屋后湖光一片明。\n寸寸地荒皆古迹，迢迢风起作寒声。\n游人过此多凄感，况际萧寥客思生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24235,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登亥元旦","author":"孙垓","text":"白发苍颜五十三，韶华回首更何堪。\n中年逢乱垂垂老，琐事都亲渐渐谙。\n暖日鼠姑舒叶嫩，春江鱼婢佐餐甘。\n岁朝礼佛无多祝，愿遂山居一觉酣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24236,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄内","author":"孙垓","text":"析桂炊珠颇不赀，衰年累尔苦支持。\n我家乞米寻常事，十万饥军待饷时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24237,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读曾文正公集","author":"孙垓","text":"挑镫对编简，仰止德愔愔。\n学术祛成见，勋名出小心。\n论文官烛灺，筹笔阵云深。\n允矣读书法，千秋佩士林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24238,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上曲","author":"顾家树","text":"衔枚度碛夜生寒，铁甲霜明北斗阑。\n边马远驰天未晓，提刀直欲靖楼兰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24239,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日偕伯兄步鄠西郊外","author":"顾家树","text":"雁影动高秋，飞云澹不收。\n相将问征羽，何日到南州。\n浅水波澜蹙，暮山烟雾稠。\n天风吹百感，凄绝此淹留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24240,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高邮道中","author":"沈守正","text":"浓淡云容顷刻非，雨丝丝里日光微。\n黏天甓社湖中水，坐看风帆叶叶飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24241,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"沈守正","text":"望里平林高复低，征车兀兀走长堤。\n杨花似欲留人住，乱向东风裹马蹄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24242,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居即事","author":"叶德徵","text":"远岫平林小板桥，江乡僻处谢尘嚣。\n风侵谭氏村前树，月落孙家渡口潮。\n雨岸荻芦秋瑟瑟，一群凫雁夜萧萧。\n渔镫明灭沙洲外，箬笠棕蓑胜黑貂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24243,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与杏林谈禅作禅语赠之","author":"曹廉锷","text":"听人说真谛，言下颇了了。\n然求上乘禅，莫若无言好。\n有时笑口开，我亦不自晓。\n持定无无想，此身亦可少。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24244,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汾源杂诗","author":"曹廉锷","text":"道是山城却水乡，小桥略彴足徜徉。\n柳阴深处垂纶坐，钓得游鳞二寸长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24245,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日至土桥过任处士庄 其一","author":"吴德纯","text":"放眼郊原阔，清幽爱郭西。\n垂杨藏野店，春水涨前溪。\n兴惬忘途远，情欢怅日低。\n穿林行几曲，遥指是高楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24246,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日至土桥过任处士庄 其二","author":"吴德纯","text":"修竹围茅舍，鸟声喜客来。\n居乡怜野逸，煮酒乐追陪。\n子秀书能读，童痴钓未回。\n殷勤重惜别，远寺暮钟催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24247,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别沈素庭","author":"郭肇","text":"大雅久不作，风尘吾所怜。\n相思隔秋水，一别暗遥天。\n海上瑶琴感，人间宝剑篇。\n漫游成底事，秦望正苍然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24248,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剡溪道中","author":"郭肇","text":"时清乏胜游，世乱辄高举。\n晨兴理清策，匍匐忘溽暑。\n剡中山水区，钟毓自太古。\n探奇兴偶逢，出险意自许。\n连峰有送迎，累时具仰俯。\n熊虎对踞蹲，龙鸾各骞舞。\n神工贵伏藏，到此气尽吐。\n度岭陂陀遮，回溪菪确聚。\n细路夹松篁，振袂惊飞雨。\n行行出木杪，下视见衡宇。\n夕霏起遥薄，回首忽无睹。\n林荒虎气遥，谷邃风力阻。\n缅彼巢居子，愿言托启处。\n方壶不可即，日暮独延伫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24249,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆吉竹山房兼怀金氏诸旧好","author":"郭肇","text":"岩卉林箊望不分，四山并作翠氤氲。\n临溪尽日常疑雨，闭户一身犹带云。\n新笋香时惟纵酒，好莺啼后又离群。\n年来频作还家梦，更为还家苦忆君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24250,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"军中曲","author":"宋泽元","text":"将军饮美酒，红炉锦绣围。\n士卒栖毳幕，寒霜拥铁衣。\n铁衣相对泪如雨，眼前哀乐是谁主。\n将军二十便封侯，那识人间征战苦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":24251,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]